<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!-- Around Europe by motorcycle, 28 May to 5 July 2026. Drawn after the fact (BRouter fastbike, city to city:
     Brussels, Paris, Bordeaux, Bilbao, Madrid, Valencia, Barcelona, Montpellier, Turin, Venice, Trieste, Ljubljana, Zadar, Dubrovnik, Kotor, Budva, Tirana, Meteora, Athens, Thessaloniki, Sofia, Pristina, Sarajevo, Belgrade, Timișoara, Budapest, Košice, Kraków, Vienna, Prague, Weimar, back to Bonn). Ridden mostly on direct country roads, not motorways; the line was routed with a bicycle profile to stay off them. No ferries.
     Thinned to 20 m. Not a recorded track. -->
